* (issue #95) unmodified from sim/sampling-frontend/testbench/'s own copy.
* NOT hand-edited: regenerate with, from the repo root:
*
*   source sim/env.sh
*   xschem -x -n -s -q --rcfile sim/xschemrc -o /tmp/xschem_out design/sampling_frontend.sch
*   grep -v '^\*\*' /tmp/xschem_out/sampling_frontend.spice | grep -v '^\.end$' \
*     > sim/sampling-cdac-handoff/testbench/sampling_frontend_dut.spice
