* (ratified 1.8V core flavor + MiM cap, DR-001) -- grep for g5v0d10v5 below
* to confirm zero matches.
*
* This experiment (sim/sampling-cdac-handoff/run_handoff.py) exercises this
* fragment TOGETHER with cdac_array_dut.spice below, tied at TOP_P/TOP_N --
* exactly how design/sar_adc_top.sch (#56) wires the two blocks -- with
* BPREF_P/BPREF_N left on their own dead-end nets (matching sar_adc_top.sch's
* actual BPREF_P_NC/BPREF_N_NC wiring) rather than driven by anything else,
* to test issue #95's question directly.
